      "incorrect": "I'm understanding you now.",
      "correct": "I understand you now.",
      "note": "**Understand** is not normally used in continuous tenses."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "I can't understand what does he want.",
      "correct": "I can't understand what he wants.",
      "note": "After **understand** and a question word, the words keep normal statement order."
    }
